ice ranges when escaping multiple characters. The fix assigns start = i + 1 after each replacement. The regression test added by the fix detects this: escaping \"\\\"a\\\"bc\" previously omitted the trailing 'b'. Both reversal regions occur exactly once and contain implementation code only. No builds or tests were run.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T20:50:24.067761+00:00"}
